    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d735">

                <pb facs="0768" n="756" sameAs="frus:frus1945v08/pg756"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867N.01/10–245: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister in Saudi Arabia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Eddy</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-10-03T19:00:00-05:00">October 3, 1945—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>297. Your 372 Oct 2.<anchor n="56" xml:id="d735-f1"/> Please advise urgently
                    whether our assumption is correct that version of Feb 14 conversation which King
                    desires to publish is memo written by you and subsequently cleared with
                    Roosevelt and King. We also assume King is proposing unilateral rather than
                    joint publication of memo and letter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
